# Image registry: the single source of truth for every third-party container
# image pinned in any Qualithm repo (Decision qualithm/pm#744, amendment
# 2026-10-03). Every reference in every repo must match its entry here.
#
# One image per line: <repo>:<exact tag>@sha256:<multi-arch index digest>
# Optional, only for a known violation another issue removes:
#   waive=<code>[,<code>] issue=<owner>/<repo>#<n>
#
# A reference in a repo that must differ from the registry is listed as
#   allow <repo> <path-glob> <reference> <reason>
# and `dx images check` reports it as allowed instead of failing.
#
# Add or bump an entry with `dx images pin <repo>:<tag>`, then check the file
# with `dx images verify`. First-party ghcr.io/qualithm/* images are not listed:
# their sha-<commit> pins belong to the release pipeline.

